upward. My rough estimate, an analyst judgment rather than a computed figure, is several percent up to about 10%. I do not adjust the multiple for this: code applies a mechanical median to the latest filed TTM. The bias is disclosed here, and it should be read as making the relative leg a generous cross-check.",
